<p>Do not send anything confidential, personal data about a third party, or anything you would not want held in an ordinary email inbox. There is no encryption beyond the transport layer and no undertaking of confidentiality.</p>

<p>Sending a pitch or a correction does not create any obligation on our part to publish, reply or credit, and does not transfer any rights in what you send. If we publish a correction that came from you, we credit you by name unless you ask us not to.</p>

